    repository: owner/repo checked
    defaultBranch: default branch name
    headSha: default branch HEAD commit checked
    checkedAt: ISO date of the run
    checks: list of {number, name, verdict, evidence}; five checks in reference order; verdict one of `ready`, `not ready`, `unverified`; evidence names a link, path or command result
